353913,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j38-5","user":{"login":"Saulo-de-Souza","id":17336909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzM2OTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17336909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza","html_url":"https://github.com/Saulo-de-Souza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T20:45:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T20:45:53Z","body":"> The pitch scale can be defined as the `p_rate_scale` parameter here:\n> \n> [godot/modules/interactive_music/audio_stream_playlist.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bf1c2583f4a13d501ec9eae58912f580fb5484ef/modules/interactive_music/audio_stream_playlist.cpp#L340)\n> \n> Line 340 in [bf1c258](/godotengine/godot/commit/bf1c2583f4a13d501ec9eae58912f580fb5484ef)\n> \n>  playback[idx]->mix(mix_buffer + i, 1.0, to_mix - i); // Fill rest of mix buffer \n> It's always `1.0` right now. There is no way to get back to the AudioStreamPlayer node from the server, so I don't know how this information could be passed around.\n\nTrying to help here, I added this line of code (line 1395 of the AudioServer.cpp file and it worked. I just don't know if it's the correct way to do it.\n\nAudioServer::get_singleton()->set_playback_speed_scale(p_pitch_scale);\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ebde1f4-f9eb-40d0-9fbf-cc34aa2b0333)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749353913/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749360923","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104527#issuecomment-2749360923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104527","id":2749360923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j3-sb","user":{"login":"Saulo-de-Souza","id":17336909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzM2OTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17336909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza","html_url":"https://github.com/Saulo-de-Souza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T20:49:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T20:50:29Z","body":"> > A escala de afinação pode ser definida como o `p_rate_scale`parâmetro aqui:\n> > [godot/modules/interactive_music/audio_stream_playlist.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bf1c2583f4a13d501ec9eae58912f580fb5484ef/modules/interactive_music/audio_stream_playlist.cpp#L340)\n> > Linha 340 em [bf1c258](/godotengine/godot/commit/bf1c2583f4a13d501ec9eae58912f580fb5484ef)\n> > playback[idx]->mix(mix_buffer + i, 1.0, to_mix - i); // Preenche o restante do buffer de mixagem \n> > É sempre `1.0`agora. Não há como voltar para o nó AudioStreamPlayer do servidor, então não sei como essa informação pode ser passada adiante.\n> \n> Tentando ajudar aqui, adicionei esta linha de código (linha 1395 do arquivo AudioServer.cpp) e funcionou. Só não sei se é a maneira correta de fazer isso.\n> \n> AudioServer::get_singleton()->definir_escala_de_velocidade_de_reprodução(escala_de_p_pitch);\n> \n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ebde1f4-f9eb-40d0-9fbf-cc34aa2b0333)\n\nI did other tests here and I don't think it's the right way, because if the pitch_scale is too high, the audio plays some whistles. Or maybe I'm forgetting something.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749360923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749374425","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104527#issuecomment-2749374425","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104527","id":2749374425,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j4B_Z","user":{"login":"Saulo-de-Souza","id":17336909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzM2OTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17336909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza","html_url":"https://github.com/Saulo-de-Souza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souz